WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,970 --> 00:00:03,970
You stay here and stare at those lunatics

2
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:04,970
I'll go find them

3
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,970
What if we can't contact you?

4
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:07,970
