5
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:08,970
No, I'll go with you

6
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:11,540
I can't let you go alone

7
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:17,060
who left behind

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,060
Don't, don't, don't

9
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:33,690
Go back and die soon

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:34,690
we were discovered

11
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:35,690
We ran separately and didn't run away.

12
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,230
Then what?

13
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,260
Then we were taken back to the B&B by a woman

14
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,260
locked up

15
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:45,420
Their boss is really a woman

16
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,420
