17
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:51,530
She said she would use us in exchange for food

18
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:54,530
Li Wei'an and I tried to sneak attack them, but it turned out

19
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:56,590
Someone in the uncle's house is infected

20
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:58,590
That woman pushed Li Weian to those crazy people

21
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:00,590
I Shen Luan jumped off the balcony
